            "review_title": "Review at Little Charm Restaurant",
            "review_text": "amanda5805\nDuncan, Canada7683 contributions\n0\nA little bit of Italy in Hanoi (Delivery)\nDec 2019\nWe arrived back at our hotel late on Christmas Day. We were hoping to get something delivered and the front desk gave us Little Charm Restaurants take out menu. We ordered a pepperoni pizza and some cheesy bread. Their prices were reasonable. It was going to be about 30mins before it arrived. They arrived on time and the food was still very hot. It was all very really good but not game changer. The pizza was much smaller then expected (Comparing to Canadian sizes).\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 2, 2020",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
