            "review_title": "Review at Little Charm Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Chas L\n174 contributions\n1\nLittle charm sums it up\nFeb 2019 • Solo\nWalking past they convinced me to have food I fancied a change so opted non Asian and for a pizza. The Pizza wasn't bad it was just average and did a job.\nAs I just got my second beer the staff asked if I wanted to pay as they wanted to go home! I saw other people also being rushed when they asked for desert they were told they restaurant was closed.\nWhy encourage people in at 9.30 when you close at 10pm I guess it's not the staffs fault I wouldn't want to work for free either!\nRead more\nWritten February 25, 2019",
